;; Simon's training stage (0.4.38, src/game/tutorial/heroes/simon.ts; docs/HEROES.md), in the
;; Castlevania courtyard-gate look: the whip at a wall candle on a low wall (gate 15), the stairs
;; up to a ledge too high to jump, a committed jump over a ditch, the Pot Roast and the Chain Whip
;; from ? blocks and the candle past the low wall only the chain reaches from it (gate 53),
;; the Dagger at a target (gate 66), the Holy Water's flame at the walkers out of the pipe (gate 80),
;; the Axe's arc at the target on the high shelf (gate 96), the Morning Star at the far candle (gate
;; 109), the Cross at a target (gate 119), the Double and Triple Shot: three axes at once (gate
;; 132), the Stopwatch freezing the fire bar to walk past it (gate 150) and the flagpole. Each power
;; block's item is in [hero-items]; the gates are laid by the tutorial.
id: training-simon
name: SIMON TRAINING
world: 5
stage: 0
theme: cv-gate
music: cv-hall
time: 400
start: 2,11
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

